The frozen development evidence says a larger residual is a candidate for semantic noncompositionality. It does not say a smaller residual is semantic compositionality. The future evidence contract is one-sided. A ready row with residual greater than or equal to `T_HIGH` is `YES`. Every other row is `UNKNOWN`. There is no `NO` output and no lower threshold. `REJECT` is not semantic no. `QUARANTINE` is not semantic no.

